Local Codex

This desktop application redistributes open-source components, including:

- Codex app-server (Apache-2.0)
- Chromium / Microsoft WebView2
- Tauri, Rust crates, and Node MCP scripts bundled under src-tauri/

Full license texts for vendored binaries and npm packages are kept next to those components. Opening this file from Help → Licenses shows this notice on machines that do not ship a packaged Chromium license file.
